        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Showed the game to about a dozen of people and everyone of them have commented about the picture being smallish, the text hard to read and the ample wasted borders and empty space on the cards.</p><p>Why did you decide on using that design ? Did the playtesters tested it ? No one complained about it before printing ?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 1397,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
        "deleted_at": null,
        "user_deleted": false,
        "edit_reason": null,
        "can_view_edit_history": true,
